english:
Light helmet used by the Fairy Guards Regiment with additional face-plating for a small degree of ballistic protection.

^orange;+10% Magic Proficiency.^reset;
^#DBC5A6;DEF: +10% SMALL-ARMS | +5% BLEED.^reset;
^#FFCE6D;Return Fire! [HEAD]: +30% DODGE and -50% projectile spread for 0.5s when firing a weapon.
^#F2B8EC;Iron Halo [FULL SET 4x] - +50 MAX HP and 1HP/s for bearer and nearby players.

korean:
요정 근위대가 쓰는 경량 헬멧으로, 소량의 탄도 보호를 위한 면갑이 추가됐다.

^orange;마법 숙련 +10%.^reset;
^#DBC5A6;방어력: 소화기 +10% | 출혈 +5%.^reset;
^#FFCE6D;반격 사격! [머리]: 무기 발사 시 0.5초간 회피 +30%와 탄착군 -50%.
^#F2B8EC;철의 후광 [풀 세트 4x] - 착용자와 근처 플레이어들에게 최대 HP +50과 1HP/초.

english:
The Fairy Guards battle uniform is lightly blessed to give it better protection against the Abyss and the Youkai. To most, it merely grants slight protection. To fairies, it brings them closer to humanity.

^orange;+10% Magic Proficiency.^reset;
^#DBC5A6;DEF: +10% DODGE | +5% SLASH | +10% PSYCHIC.^reset;
^#F2B8EC;Iron Halo [FULL SET 4x] - Refer to the Fairy Guards Helmet.

korean:
요정 근위대 전투복은 심연과 요괴에 대한 보호를 높이도록 살짝 축복됐다. 대부분에게는 단지 약간의 보호를 줄 뿐이다. 요정들에게는 그들을 인류에 더 가깝게 해준다.

^orange;마법 숙련 +10%.^reset;
^#DBC5A6;방어력: 회피 +10% | 참격 +5% | 사이킥 +10%.^reset;
^#F2B8EC;철의 후광 [풀 세트 4x] - 요정 근위대 헬멧 참조.

english:
The Guardian of Nod must be bested by an unknown warrior, in the land where dead men walk once more. Until then, who wears the crown is both Guardian and Protector of a land of exiles, where those strong enough to meaningfully change reality might soon tread.
^#FF6060;Blood Leecher [CHEST] - +1% HP/s when coated in blood from enemies. Most organic soldiers will bleed a little. Elites will explode with more blood.
^#DBC5A6;DEF: +20% SLASH | +10% THRUST.^reset;

korean:
