english:
Historically, shrine maiden was a generational position, and the training was intense, lasting from 3 to 8 years. Modern shrine maidens, however, are mostly just schoolgirls working part-time, selling omamori and cleaning shrines.
^#DBC5A6;DEF: +15% SLASH | +5% THRUST | +20% PSYCHIC.^reset;
