english:
In 1873, the Meiji government issued an ordinance called the Miko Kindanrei, essentially outlawing all miko activities. Only in 1940 the ban was lifted, as government was trying to redefine Shinto as a secular, non-religious set of inherently Japanese traditions. 
^#DBC5A6;DEF: +10% SLASH | +5% THRUST | 10% PSYCHIC.^reset;
^#F4988C;Hand-to-Hand Cleansing [LEGS] - Nearby enemies within 40 blocks take +25% PSYCHIC DMG.^reset;
^#F2B8EC;Highly Responsive To Prayers [FULL SET 3x REQUIRED] - Swinging a melee weapon sends out a talisman.

korean:
1873년 메이지 정부는 미코 금단령이라는 조례를 발해 사실상 모든 무녀 활동을 금지했다. 금지는 1940년에야 풀렸는데, 정부가 신토를 비종교적이고 일본 고유의 전통 집합으로 재정의하려 했기 때문이다.
